elry accessible through our hassle-free purchase process.", "is_public": true, "score": 4, "href": "/repository/alizakat/london_blue_topaz_ring"}, {"kind": "repository", "title": "repo", "namespace": {"title": "user", "kind": "user", "avatar": {"name": "lopepene310", "hash": "9910fb5394d331afe6da3c148bda2e38", "color": "#31a354", "kind": "user"}, "name": "lopepene310", "score": 1, "href": "/user/lopepene310"}, "name": "lopepene", "description": "Hi, I am Lope Pene. I have been working as a content writer for the last four years at Rananjay Exports, which deals in manufacturing Sterling silver gemstone jewelry. We have a wide range of <a href=\"https://www.rananjayexports.com/gemstones/london-blue-topaz\">London Blue Topaz Jewelry</a>with other 150 plus gemstones jewelry accessories. I have been reading and writing about gemstones for several years. Since my beginning in the writing field, I have written many articles on gemstones. I try to express my genuine opinion and knowledge about crystals in my articles and try to satisfy your quest so that you can get an authentic product. Providing authentic information and good quality products is our primary purpose.", "is_public": true, "score": 4, "href": "/repository/lopepene310/lopepene"}, {"kind": "repository", "title": "repo", "namespace": {"title": "user", "kind": "user", "avatar": {"name": "whbengenharia", "hash": "d2cdaac1e23496fd33424065a2176f13", "color": "#17becf", "kind": "user"}, "name": "whbengenharia", "score": 1, "href": "/user/whbengenharia"}, "name": "whbengenharia", "description": "`<p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"height:500px; width:500px\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://whbengenharia.com.br/\"><strong>aquecimento solar em Contagem</strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Solar water heating systems from WHB Engenharia serve Minas Gerais properties with renewable energy, reducing electric heater dependency and cutting monthly energy bills significantly.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n`", "i